> Full placement guide: invoke `/repo-layout`. Project name and reference module: `.agents/patterns/project-facts.md`.

## Root

```
{ProjectName}/
├── .agents/          # checklists, patterns, examples
├── .cursor/          # rules, skills
├── docs/security/RBAC_MATRIX.md
├── src/
│   ├── Api/
│   ├── Core/{Module}/   # .Domain / .Application / .Infrastructure
│   ├── Shared/Kernel.{Domain,Application,Infrastructure}/
│   └── Tools/Migrator/
├── tests/
│   ├── ArchitectureTests/
│   ├── UnitTests/
│   ├── IntegrationTests/
│   ├── CommonTests/
│   └── E2ETests/
└── Product.Template.sln   # see project-facts.md for actual name
```

## Module triple (required for new bounded contexts)

```
src/Core/{Module}/
├── {Module}.Domain/         Entities, VOs, Events, Repository interfaces
├── {Module}.Application/    Handlers, Queries, Validators, Mappers, Permissions
└── {Module}.Infrastructure/ Persistence, Seeders, DependencyInjection.cs
```

## Tests layout

```
tests/
├── UnitTests/{Feature}/           # handlers, validators, domain
├── IntegrationTests/{Module}/     # HTTP + auth
├── ArchitectureTests/             # layer & naming gates
├── CommonTests/Common/            # BaseFixture
└── E2ETests/Security/
    └── RbacMatrixConsistencyTests.cs
```

## Placement rules

1. Never create files outside this structure without updating `/repo-layout`.
2. New module → full Domain / Application / Infrastructure triple + DI + MediatR registration.
3. Controller → `src/Api/Controllers/v1/{Module}Controller.cs`.
4. EF configuration → `src/Shared/Kernel.Infrastructure/Persistence/Configurations/`.
5. Authorization entities → `Authorization.Domain` (not Identity).
6. Tenant entity → `Tenants.Domain` (does **not** implement `IMultiTenantEntity`).
7. Design-time `AppDbContext` factory → `src/Api/`.
